# standard.random — EAV-native seeded RNG (§27 planned; §30.5.3 authority model).
#
# Parity with semsc's `std/random` surface, the EAV-clean way: randomness is
# authority. Drawing a *seed* from the environment is a capability-mediated effect
# (`seedFromEntropy`), so a seeded-random capability makes a run reproducible
# (§30.5.3) and replayable under `mode capturedOutputReplay`. The PRNG step
# itself (`nextRandom`) is a pure, deterministic LCG over an Int64 state — same
# seed, same sequence — so it needs no authority and lowers to plain arithmetic.

standardRandom is module
standardRandom path standard.random
standardRandom purpose "Seeded deterministic RNG with a capability-gated entropy seed"
standardRandom invariant "nextRandom is pure (same seed, same sequence); seeding from entropy is capability-mediated"

entropySource is capability
entropySource grants read random.entropy
entropySource purpose "Authority to draw a non-deterministic seed from the environment"

seedFromEntropy is operation
seedFromEntropy out Int64
seedFromEntropy effect read random.entropy
seedFromEntropy uses entropySource
seedFromEntropy body runtimeBinding eav_http_now_millis
seedFromEntropy purpose "Draw a non-deterministic seed (capability-gated); inject a fixed seed for determinism"

nextRandom is operation
nextRandom in state Int64
nextRandom out Int64
nextRandom async no
nextRandom purpose "Advance the PRNG state one step with a 64-bit LCG (pure, wrapping)"
nextRandom invariant "Deterministic: the same state always yields the same next state"
nextRandom let multiplier immutable Int64 6364136223846793005
nextRandom let increment immutable Int64 1442695040888963407
nextRandom do scaleState
nextRandom do addIncrement
nextRandom return advancedState

scaleState is call
scaleState in nextRandom
scaleState invokes math.multiplyInt64
scaleState arg left Int64 state
scaleState arg right Int64 multiplier
scaleState out scaledState Int64

addIncrement is call
addIncrement in nextRandom
addIncrement invokes math.addInt64
addIncrement arg left Int64 scaledState
addIncrement arg right Int64 increment
addIncrement out advancedState Int64
